# fynns UI design system (pointer)

Authority: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md). Install / consume:
[`llm/CONSUME.md`](../../llm/CONSUME.md). Treaty **slug index** (no essays):
[`llm/CONSUMER_TREATY.md`](../../llm/CONSUMER_TREATY.md). Pasteable consumer
rule: [`llm/consumer-cursor-rule.mdc`](../../llm/consumer-cursor-rule.mdc).
Purge / migration: [`llm/BREAKING_PURGE.md`](../../llm/BREAKING_PURGE.md).
Publish: [`docs/package-propagation.md`](../../docs/package-propagation.md).

## Hard (always)

- Build from `@fynns/ui` keep-set only; no `@radix-ui/*`, no `sonner`, no revived
  purged APIs (Toast / Popover / Panel* / BlockingLoadingOverlay / …).
- Style with `var(--fynns-*)` only — never hardcode hex/rgba or invent shell
  insets / private radius vars.
- Consumers are **props-only** — no local `.fynns-*` restyles; **never** patch
  keep-set Select/Menu/SearchBar **radius / expand chrome** in a consumer
  (agents-hub included) — land in this core + sandbox `#select` / `#menu`
  first. Missing capability → core, then refresh sibling / optional publish.
- Day-to-day consume = **zero-token sibling `file:`** (`llm/CONSUME.md`) — no
  `NODE_AUTH_TOKEN` for clone→install→dev.
- Sandbox Globals/Preview = consumer default; keep `SANDBOX_DEFAULT_OVERRIDES`
  empty; demo ↔ barrel stay atomic (`npm run check:wysiwyg`).
- No consumer product copy in core/sandbox — see `no-consumer-content` rule +
  `npm run check:no-consumer`.
- Destination apps: prefer `DestinationAppShell`; inspector = `EndAside`;
  blocking/sectional busy = `BusyScrim` / `BusyRegion` (+ `runBusyTask`).
- Dense chrome lists / Timeline / 「下一个」 → use the matching **on-demand**
  rules (`chrome-proportion`, `timeline-catalog`, `m3-next`) or read AGENTS
  sections — do not re-paste catalogs into this file.

When unsure about a primitive or density recipe: **Read `AGENTS.md`** (Content
density / Hard rules) rather than guessing from memory.
